  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vietnet-ICT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall Objective (OO): To enhance the role of NSAs in accelerating an inclusive and gender-responsive digital transformation in Viet Nam.
Specific Objective 1 (S01) - Youth (15-30): To amplify youth voices and strengthen the capacity of NSAs and youth-based organizations to contribute to technology-related policymaking towards an inclusive and gender-responsive digital transformation.
Specific Objective 2 (S02) - Human-centred digital education : To strengthen the digital literacy and skills of youth,disadvantaged youth and girls, (through enhanced science, technology, engineering, and mathematics,STEM, curricula), and digital training, providing opportunities for decent work in the digital services sector.
S01: Outputs: Op1.1 Youth have increased digital skills in research and media reporting of technology-related policies. Op1.2 Youth have strengthened capacity to engage in technology-related policy influencing, formulation and implementation, and to lead technology-related policy events and campaigns.
S02: Outputs: Op2.1 Teachers can deliver enhanced STEM curricula through blended learning using digital education. Op2.2 Girls and disadvantaged youth have increased awareness and IT skills relevant to the job market. Op2.3 Youth have increased awareness and skills around online harms and digital safety via access to a Digital Safety Hub.</narrative>
  </description>
